{"availability":"available","full":"maxgfr/kanbo","name":"kanbo","description":"Local-first project management: kanban, sprints and roadmap in your browser, with a git repo as the only backend.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-08-07T10:36:30Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:01:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://maxgfr.github.io/kanbo/","topics":["agile","end-to-end-encryption","github-pages","kanban","local-first","no-backend","offline-first","project-management","pwa","react","scrum","typescript"],"demo":"https://maxgfr.github.io/kanbo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.760Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.760Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.760Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.760Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Local-first project management. Kanban, sprints and roadmap in your browser, with a git repo as the only backend.","There is no server, no account and no database of ours. Kanbo runs in two modes, and the difference between them is enforced by the browser rather than promised by us."],"features":["Board with real drag and drop, operable entirely from the keyboard, WIP limits, and a status chip that flips like a departure board when someone else moves a card. Filter it to a sprint without leaving the board, with…","History on everything. Kanbo stores changes rather than state, so an activity feed needs no recording of its own — it is a reading of the same log the board is built from, and cannot drift from it or be quietly edited.…","Sprints with a goal, capacity, burndown and velocity. The burndown carries scope changes as their own series, because drawing only the remaining line makes a sprint that grew look like a team that stalled — and it stops…","Flow metrics — cycle time as percentiles rather than an average, cumulative flow, throughput, aging work in progress. Every figure is derived from the board's own history; nothing is recorded twice, so nothing can drift.","Roadmap with dependency arrows drawn in the grammar of a technical drawing, milestones, and blocking links that refuse to form a cycle. An item with no dates gets no bar: a roadmap that invents a schedule is the most…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0aad8af66b04697ee26c7ea921c24249e9f65b97560fdf4ab1ead3d1a4fee3d6","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.901Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.901Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Local-first project management. Kanban, sprints and roadmap in your browser, with a git repo as the only backend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"There is no server, no account and no database of ours.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"connect.html names no host, because a list fixed at build time could never cover a self-hosted Gitea on a domain we have never heard of.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0aad8af66b04697ee26c7ea921c24249e9f65b97560fdf4ab1ead3d1a4fee3d6","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.902Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T15:01:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/maxgfr/kanbo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:25:56.903Z","hash":"0aad8af66b04697ee26c7ea921c24249e9f65b97560fdf4ab1ead3d1a4fee3d6","originalBytes":16315,"storedBytes":16315,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kanbo","one","same","board","what","nothing","which","browser","check","command","packages","rather","sprint","every","kanbo-board","npx","domain","mcp","only","request","skill","terminal","against","because","ca